WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,340 --> 00:00:05,940
Your kid just brought over 8,000 yuan to a credit union.

2
00:00:05,940 --> 00:00:08,020
How can you find another 10,000 yuan?

3
00:00:08,020 --> 00:00:09,220
Don't say it was borrowed

4
00:00:09,220 --> 00:00:12,620
Even if we ask for donations from the entire village, we won't be able to donate so much. Master Qi

5
00:00:12,620 --> 00:00:14,420
have you ever heard a sentence

6
00:00:14,420 --> 00:00:16,580
It's called one thing is extraordinary and two masters

7
00:00:16,580 --> 00:00:18,020
what does it mean

8
00:00:18,020 --> 00:00:21,940
Are you going to borrow the second payment?

9
00:00:21,940 --> 00:00:28,220
The policy for bringing money is very relaxed now

10
00:00:28,220 --> 00:00:30,780
The shabby land and house I used to rely on at home

11
00:00:30,780 --> 00:00:32,540
You can bring out more than 8,000 yuan

12
00:00:32,540 --> 00:00:35,300
As long as this seventeen-meter ship falls under my name

13
00:00:35,300 --> 00:00:38,340
It's easy to bring out more than 10,000 yuan with this ship

14
00:00:38,780 --> 00:00:42,260
Then I just need to use the new game brought out

15
00:00:42,260 --> 00:00:46,680
Qianchuan, which is often returned, can be bought with borrowed money.

16
00:00:46,680 --> 00:00:49,480
Then use the money from the boat to pay back the borrowed money

17
00:00:49,480 --> 00:00:51,680
I'm taking the opportunity to make a living here.

18
00:00:51,680 --> 00:00:55,210
This operation is simply not stable.

19
00:00:55,210 --> 00:00:59,150
Are you sure this will work?

20
00:00:59,150 --> 00:01:00,830
As long as Changsun Sun is willing to let me pay the bill

21
00:01:00,830 --> 00:01:02,070
I can definitely handle it
